# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# Output that may describe your private repos - never commit it to the public engine.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `*-audit.md` also matched ECC's commands/harness-audit.md,
# silently dropping it from the vendored library and breaking the capabilities check on every CI runner.
/digests/
/*-audit.md
/*-audit.json
/creds.csv
# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
